export anchor BigAndSimpleStyle:
    number: 45
    screen: Settings
    name: Big and simple
    idea: One wide column of extra large text and huge tap targets in plain words, built for low vision and older users with AAA contrast everywhere.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #ffffff, the background everywhere
        ink: #111111, text, row borders and ticked boxes
        softInk: #333333, hints and the Off word
        blue: #0a3a82, links, the primary button, the current section and the focus outline
        blueSoft: #e6eefb, the row being focused
        green: #0b5a2a, the On word and the saved note on #e3f3e8
        red: #8a1010, the danger zone on #fbeaea
    type:
        A wide, clear sans with a large x height, Verdana, Tahoma, Segoe UI,
        DejaVu Sans, sans-serif. Body text is 22px at 1.6 line height and
        never goes below 20px. The page title is 44px bold, section titles
        34px bold, group labels 26px bold, row text 22px bold and hints
        20px regular. At phone width the body drops to 20px.
    layout:
        A single centred column 760px wide. A header with the brand and
        Signed in as Mara Okafor sits above a 3px rule. The five sections
        are a stack of full width rows, with the current one filled blue
        and marked You are here. Then the Notifications rows, the Time and
        language fields, the digest radios, two full width stacked buttons,
        the saved note and the danger box. Nothing sits side by side.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between rows, 24px inside rows, 56px above each section heading.
    density: Very low. One thing per row, about five rows per screen.
    corners: 14px on rows, fields and buttons, 10px on tick boxes, round radio dots.
    borders: 3px solid #222222 on every row and field, 4px on tick boxes and the danger box.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Few and large, 32 to 44px, always next to a word. A white tick in a
        filled black box means on and an empty box means off, with the word
        On or Off at the end of the row. A filled dot in a ring marks the
        chosen radio and its label is underlined. A filled green circle
        tick shows Changes saved and a solid red triangle heads the danger
        zone. Sections that are not current end in a plain arrow.
    focus: A 5px #0a3a82 outline offset 4px, and the focused row turns #e6eefb.
    tone: Plain short instructions, such as You are here and Tick a box to turn a message on.
